  "id": "wireup-reference-coastal-24h",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "A 24-hour reference coastal series for environment tests: hourly wind, air temperature, sea-surface temperature, barometric pressure and significant wave height. It is a deterministic synthetic series generated by a seeded model, NOT an observation of any real place. It exists so that environment-dependent behaviour is reproducible offline.",
  "source": "WireUp synthetic generator (seeded sum-of-harmonics), no third-party data",
  "licence": "CC0-1.0",
  "attribution": "None required. Cite as: WireUp reference coastal 24h series (synthetic).",
